    "name": "adp_person_current_snapshot",
    "resource_type": "snapshot",
    "package_name": "fishtown_internal_analytics",
    "description": "Timeseries of person-level attributes. The source table from Fivetran is very unique in that it includes versioned records but it does not maintain all changes that occur throughout history.  Therefore, since we cannot rely on the versioned table from Fivetran to have the complete history, we need to take snapshots in the data warehouse.  In addition, the snapshots have to be made off of a model with just the current records because it does not make sense to take snapshots  of a slowly-changing dimension.\n",
